// Spain's official public holidays (fiestas laborales), national and by
// comunidad autónoma, as the BOE publishes them each October for the year
// after -- with that year's substitutions already applied (a holiday that
// falls on a Sunday moved to the Monday, San José in some years and not
// others), which is why this is a table per year and not a rule.
//
// Generated by scripts/boe-holidays.mjs from the Dirección General de
// Trabajo's resolution; add a year by running it with the new BOE id. A year
// missing here is simply not closed yet: clinics with automatic holidays get
// it from the daily cron as soon as a deploy carries it
// (server/utils/publicHolidays.ts).
//
// The two local holidays of each municipality are not in the BOE (each
// province publishes its own), nor are the ones for part of a comunidad that
// it gives only in a footnote -- each Canary island's own day, Arán's -- so
// clinics add those by hand.

